    <!-- Disclaimer (full) -->
    <string name="disclaimer_p1">Prayer times are calculated from your location and the selected method. They are estimates. Actual times can differ because of local horizon, weather, elevation, and differing scholarly opinions on how each time is defined.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_p2">If your local mosque or the scholar you follow publishes a timetable, follow that. You can adjust each time in Settings → Manual adjustments.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_p3">The Qibla direction is calculated from your location. Phone compasses can be thrown off by metal, magnets or phone cases, so calibrate by moving your phone in a figure-8 and double-check when possible.</string>

